ATTRIBUTION

Luminex is a chess engine that originally derived from Stockfish
(https://stockfishchess.org). While the search, evaluation, and
higher-level architecture have been substantially rewritten with
original techniques (Phased Move Generation, Forcing Line Extension,
etc.), some foundational utilities remain based on Stockfish code.

Stockfish is licensed under the GNU General Public License v3 and is
copyright (C) the Stockfish developers. The full text of the GPL v3
is available at <https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt>.
